<title>USA: PremiumWear signs three-year credit pact.</title>
<headline>PremiumWear signs three-year credit pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PremiumWear Inc said Wednesday it entered into a three-year revolving credit line agreement with First Bank National Association of Minneapolis, a unit of First Bank System Inc, worth $6 million.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement provides funds that will allow for continued growth of its special markets business.</p>
<p>PremiumWear markets Munsingwear brand knit shirts and other apparel items to premium and special market industries under a license from Supreme International Corp.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
